  "description": "Named after our address on Stadhouderskade 12, Bar TWLV is inspired by the universal symbolism of the number 12: a reflection of balance, rhythm, and connection. From brunch to late-night drinks, this vibrant new space transitions effortlessly throughout the day, offering something for every moment.\n\nExpect international sharing dishes, a zodiac-inspired cocktail menu, and an atmosphere that blends cosmopolitan flair with laid-back comfort. Whether you're visiting from afar or just around the corner — you're invited.",
